e that transforms advanced advertising technology into growth engines for businesses across the global ecosystem.</div></div><div class="mv-point" data-v-0c208207><div class="mv-point-t" data-v-0c208207>Proven Operational Expertise</div><div class="mv-point-d" data-v-0c208207>Our core team has spent more than five years building and operating large-scale programmatic advertising infrastructure. With experience managing high-concurrency systems that process hundreds of billions of daily ad requests, we engineer every layer of the platform for performance, reliability, and precision.</div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="mv-team-media lp-reveal" data-v-0c208207><span class="mv-deco mv-deco--ring-accent" style="top:-6%;right:6%;width:48px;height:48px;" data-v-0c208207></span><span class="mv-deco mv-deco--dots-ink" style="bottom:-6%;left:-2%;width:74px;height:52px;" data-v-0c208207></span><div class="mv-founder" data-v-0c208207><div class="mv-founder-top" data-v-0c208207><div class="mv-avatar-wrap" data-v-0c208207><img class="mv-avatar" src="/founder-zhu-xiaoqiang.png" alt="Xiaoqiang Zhu" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy" data-v-0c208207></div><div data-v-0c208207><div class="mv-founder-name" data-v-0c208207>Xiaoqiang Zhu</div><div class="mv-founder-role" data-v-0c208207>Founder</div></div></div><div class="mv-founder-bio" data-v-0c208207><!--[--><p data-v-0c208207>AlgoGear was founded by Xiaoqiang Zhu, former Chief AI Officer (CAIO) of Mobvista and a recognized leader in mobile advertising and AI.</p><p data-v-0c208207>A graduate of Tsinghua University, Xiaoqiang has more than a decade of experience building advertising products and AI systems at leading technology companies. At Alibaba, he helped scale the display advertising business to annual revenues exceeding RMB 100 billion. He later joined Mobvista, where he led the development of the AI engine powering Mintegral&#39;s programmatic advertising platform, supporting a business that processes over US$10 billion in annual transaction volume. Driven by a belief that advanced advertising technology should be open and accessible, he founded AlgoGear to transform proven AI infrastructure into an open foundation for the next generation of programmatic advertising.</p><!--]--></div></div></div></div></section><section class="lp-section lp-section-soft mv-endorse" id="endorsements" aria-labelledby="mv-endorse-title" data-v-f2f3a34a><div class="lp-container" data-v-f2f3a34a><header class="mv-endorse-head lp-reveal" data-v-f2f3a34a><h2 id="mv-endorse-title" class="mv-endorse-title" data-v-f2f3a34a>Partner Voices</h2><p class="mv-endorse-sub" data-v-f2f3a34a>Building an industry-leading open programmatic ecosystem with outstanding partners</p></header><div class="mv-endorse-grid" data-v-f2f3a34a><!--[--><article class="mv-endorse-item lp-reveal" data-v-f2f3a34a><div class="mv-endorse-brand" data-v-f2f3a34a><div class="mv-endorse-logo-wrap" data-v-f2f3a34a><img class="mv-endorse-logo--lacuna mv-endorse-logo" src="/partners/lacuna.png" alt="Lacuna" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-f2f3a34a></div><span class="mv-endorse-badge" data-v-f2f3a34a>Open-DSP (Beta Testing) Partner</span></div><blockquote class="mv-endorse-quote" data-v-f2f3a34a><span class="mv-endorse-mark" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f2f3a34a>“</span><p data-v-f2f3a34a>Partnering with AlgoGear Open-DSP, we amplify platform momentum together, expand our programmatic footprint efficiently, and keep driving greater business value.</p></blockquote><footer class="mv-endorse-meta" data-v-f2f3a34a><span class="mv-endorse-name" data-v-f2f3a34a>Lacuna</span><span class="mv-endorse-role" data-v-f2f3a34a>The first batch of partners</span></footer></article><article class="mv-endorse-item lp-reveal" data-v-f2f3a34a><div class="mv-endorse-brand" data-v-f2f3a34a><div class="mv-endorse-logo-wrap" data-v-f2f3a34a><img class="mv-endorse-logo--bidmatrix mv-endorse-logo" src="/partners/bidmatrix.png" alt="BidMatrix" loading="lazy" dec